import appearance.dl
import vocabulary_guide.dl

document farm guide using farm card appearance:
    paragraph "How your farm grows" using farm heading appearance
    paragraph "Fields: hoe → plow, seeds → plant, full bucket → water. Harvest ripe crops and save their scraps. Rain and pond-connected channels keep beds wet." using farm body appearance
    paragraph "Animals: start with two chickens. Feed them wheat and collect their eggs. The second village order brings a cow; feed it hay to get milk." using farm body appearance
    paragraph "Compost: scraps mature into fertilizer after 20 turns. Fertilized crops grow twice as fast." using farm body appearance
    paragraph "Teamwork: give items to adjacent workers, or leave piles for a porter. Fill village orders to welcome more workers and open the east field." using farm body appearance

document farm language guide using farm card appearance:
    paragraph "Words your workers understand" using farm heading appearance
    link "Show Farm vocabulary" to "action:farm-vocabulary" using farm action appearance
    view group "Farm vocabulary panel" using no UI appearance:
        tab group "Farm vocabulary chapters" using farm vocabulary tabs appearance:
            tab "Actions":
                paragraph "Farm action examples" containing "" using farm example appearance
                paragraph "Farm quantity and sharing examples" containing "store 2 logs\nstore everything\ngive logs to a nearby worker" using farm example appearance
            tab "Checks":
                paragraph "Farm condition examples" containing "" using farm example appearance
            tab "Places":
                paragraph "Farm destination examples" containing "" using farm example appearance
                paragraph "Search within a named work area:" using farm body appearance
                paragraph "Farm work area example" containing "walk to the nearest thirsty crop in the area \"Vegetable patch\"" using farm example appearance
            tab "Items":
                paragraph "Farm supply examples" containing "" using farm example appearance
    paragraph "Name reusable instructions with to tend a bed:. Use if …:, else:, loop 3 times: or loop forever:. Each action takes a turn; conditions read the farm as it is now." using farm body appearance
    paragraph "Grab, take, collect and pick up mean the same thing. Grab nearby items, or name their source. A named item takes up to one bag's worth; a number chooses the amount; everything fills the available hands." using farm body appearance
    paragraph "Flags are movable destinations. Walk to the red flag stops beside it and faces its square. Drag that flag to give workers a new work site. Named work areas let workers search for jobs within a field." using farm body appearance
